/*!

*\page umount Umount (unmount an SD card)
*
* This instruction is used to unmount an SD card.
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
* <span style='color:blue'>umount </span><br>
*  or<br>
* <span style='color:blue'>unmount </span>
*
* <span style='color:green'><strong>Note:</strong></span><br>
* An SD-card module must be connected to the Nucleo board through SPI, with an SD card inserted and mounted before using this instruction.
*/
